{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"summative evaluation summative evaluation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md","fileName":"Summative Evaluation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Summative Evaluation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[UX Evaluation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Formative Evaluation","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"summative evaluation summative evaluation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Summative Evaluation.md","fileName":"Summative Evaluation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Summative Evaluation","heading":"Summative Evaluation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Summative evaluation assesses a substantially complete interface against target values or compares two or more designs, components, or techniques. It helps sum up the quality and consequences of design choices.\n\nRepresentative users perform consistent task scenarios while evaluators collect qualitative and quantitative results. Formal summative experiments vary independent variables, measure dependent variables, and control other factors so observed effects can be attributed to the design conditions.\n\nSummative evaluation complements [[Formative Evaluation]]. Formative work refines the design; summative work measures the resulting design or compares alternatives.","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Formative Evaluation","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full